{"ref":"BDB, שַׁמּוּעַ","hw":"שַׁמּוּעַ","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">שַׁמּוּעַ</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. </strong><br><strong>1.</strong>  son of David <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 5:14\" href=\"/II_Samuel.5.14\">2 S 5:14</a> = <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 14:4\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.14.4\">1 Ch 14:4</a>, Σαμμους[ε], Σαμαα (= <span dir=\"rtl\">שִׁמְעָא</span> <strong>2</strong>).<br><strong>2.</strong>  Reubenite, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 13:4\" href=\"/Numbers.13.4\">Nu 13:4</a>, Σαμουηλ, Σαλαμιηλ, etc.<br><strong>3.</strong>  Levite, <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 11:17\" href=\"/Nehemiah.11.17\">Ne 11:17</a> (= <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁמַעְיָה</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 9:16\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.9.16\">1 Ch 9:16</a>), Σαμουει, etc.; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 12:18\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.12.18\">12:18</a> (? same person), 𝔊L Σαμουε.","next":"BDB, שִׁמְעוֹן","prev":"BDB, שְׁמוּעָה"}